{"canonical_record":{"canonical_payload_sha256":"724e35ee5b0f2ad71d8bdbd0614ffbf40719046c4ebbf7465d0313b97f7c39ca","full_review_record_id":"fullrev_95b5614dadfbfa762ceddd0035ab31646eba72ed03b5a42a58111944661da47c","overall_assessment":"The paper presents a technical contribution to semi-supervised learning using CC-GANs. The supplied evidence is insufficient to determine specific policy compliance regarding anonymity, plagiarism, or broader impact documentation, as the paper does not contain the required metadata or explicit compliance statements for these specific policy dimensions.","paper_id":"BJ--gPcxl","paper_identity_sha256":"72a7e6c191efcd490fc7364180ad327d97dd23c5e32bf9e782a13e954284a4c5","prompt_identity_sha256":"90d462ab2e13ecad771afe24161b2473e02aea9de6e842a4a96a0f86a6c538cc","raw_response_sha256":"8eaf967e15acf8201605016ff9bc47da166245aa2e61ff321b7502f2e8f30386","request_identity_sha256":"7fd94e514bfd2bc8011d4bd33c1e8566a6bc62be83c962f201a5b2f1ec997b49","reviewer_identity_sha256":"32b29c26fbf1508e066dfb25b1a9a3fe0654c5869a7da3020e1e8e61940befe3","role":"POL","schema_version":"agentreview-full-review-corpus-v4","structural_context_sha256":"6fb2824d0bdeecc733a7272f744c73c196d7a311e4a7545b8d29149a0256394f","subdimension_sections":[{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The paper does not discuss ethical risks, fairness, bias, or potential harms associated with the proposed semi-supervised learning method. There is no mention of dual-use concerns or mitigation strategies for the generative model. The evidence is limited to the technical description of the method and its performance on standard benchmarks.","subdimension_id":"POL-ETH"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-021","SRC-023"],"review_text":"The paper utilizes the STL-10 and PASCAL VOC 2007 datasets. The text describes the composition of these datasets (e.g., number of images, classes) but does not explicitly state the licensing terms, consent protocols, or privacy compliance measures for the data used. The evidence does not confirm or deny adherence to specific data usage policies.","subdimension_id":"POL-DAT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-001"],"review_text":"The paper explicitly lists the authors (Emily Denton, Sam Gross, Rob Fergus) and their affiliations (New York University, Facebook AI Research) on the title page. Without a frozen venue policy confirming whether this submission was required to be double-blind, it is not possible to declare a violation. The visible names and affiliations are noted as a factual observation.","subdimension_id":"POL-ANO"},{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The paper cites relevant prior work, including the context-encoder approach of Pathak et al. (2016) and other GAN variants. There is no explicit disclosure of dual submission or plagiarism. The supplied evidence is insufficient to audit for textual overlap or verify originality beyond the provided citations.","subdimension_id":"POL-PLG"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-029"],"review_text":"The paper provides a GitHub URL for the code and models (https://github.com/edenton/cc-gan) in the discussion section. It does not include a broader impact statement, a checklist, or explicit software/data license identifiers. The evidence is insufficient to determine compliance with specific policy requirements for broader impact documentation or licensing.","subdimension_id":"POL-IMP"}]},"disposition":"CANONICAL_FULL_REVIEW_COMMITTED","item_commit_sha256":"40a5d9c99b8859d360b607db82e77d04bbfcd10334f89bf231c18b1f0e1fb022","paper_id":"BJ--gPcxl","paper_ordinal":17,"raw_attempts":[{"assistant_content_base64":"","assistant_content_sha256":"8eaf967e15acf8201605016ff9bc47da166245aa2e61ff321b7502f2e8f30386","attempt_index":0,"error":"","finish_reason":"stop","paper_id":"BJ--gPcxl","raw_provider_response_base64":"","raw_provider_response_sha256":"f5308468a384776f808c0396a9b5049d03857b31d4b2614fa215a24c9f4283b7","request_identity_sha256":"7fd94e514bfd2bc8011d4bd33c1e8566a6bc62be83c962f201a5b2f1ec997b49","role"